}
}
}
Then reindex the old index to that new index:
POST _reindex
{
"source": {
"index": "my-index"
},
"dest": {
"index": "my-new-index"
}
}
If you frequently update index analyzers, use index aliases to maintain a consistent path to the
latest index:
POST _aliases
{
"actions": [
{
"remove": {
"index": "my-index",
"alias": "latest-index"
}
},
{
"add": {
"index": "my-new-index",
"alias": "latest-index"
}
}
]
}
If you don't need the old index, delete it:
DELETE my-index
